[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2745939008","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104392#issuecomment-2745939008","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104392","id":2745939008,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6jq7RA","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-23T00:43:49Z","updated_at":"2025-03-23T23:55:35Z","body":"I can confirm this on 4.5.dev 2303ce843 (Windows 11 24H2, GeForce RTX 4090). The issue seems to be GUI-related: the button physically can't be pressed, even by pressing <kbd>Space</kbd> or <kbd>Enter</kbd> (it's focused automatically). The issue persists when using **Single Window Mode** in the Editor Settings, or if you alt-tab out and back in.\n\nThere's a chance this is OS-specific and may not happen on Linux, due to differences in window handling.\n\ncc @badsectoracula, as they implemented lightmap bake canceling in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99483.\n\n**Testing project:** [test-lightmap-bake-cancel.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19412188/test-lightmap-bake