\n### Single-window mode enabled\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/570e002c-5f26-4c63-84cc-54565bba3415\n\n> I replicated this bug on 4.5.dev on a macOS and the cancel button wasn't working, but I also had to force quit the godot software. Is this kind of crashing specific to my device or is it happening for everyone who replicates this bug?\n\nThe freeze is likely unrelated. If you're using Compatibility, this is likely https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102696.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2791083510/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2952810540","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104392#issuecomment-2952810540","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104392","id":2952810540,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6wAFAs","user":{"login":"passivestar","id":60579014,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwNTc5MDE0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60579014?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar","html_url":"https://github.com/passivestar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-07T17:52:26Z","updated_at":"2025-06-07T17:52:26Z","body":"Can confirm on macOS 4.5 master and eariler, the button never worked for me ever since it was added","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2952810540/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2965582019","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104392#issuecomment-2965582019","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104392","id":2965582019,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6wwzDD","user":{"login":"lander-vr","id":31851431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxODUxNDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31851431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr","html_url":"https://github.com/lander-vr","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-12T08:10:53Z","updated_at":"2025-06-12T08:10:53Z","body":"Same thing here on Windows 10, on 4.5 master and earlier (Also ever since it was added).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2965582019/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3572140913","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104392#issuecomment-3572140913","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104392","id":3572140913,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7U6otx","user":{"login":"Geometror","id":50084500,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwMDg0NTAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50084500?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror","html_url":"https://github.com/Geometror","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-24T18:22:37Z","updated_at":"2025-11-24T18:22:37Z","body":"Still reproducible on Windows 11, while it works on Linux/Wayland. \nAfter investigating the issue and trying many different things, the problem seems to be related to this bit:\n```cpp\nvoid ProgressDialog::_update_ui() {\n\t// Run main loop for two frames.\n\tif (is_inside_tree()) {\n\t\tDisplayServer::get_singleton()->process_events();\n\t\tMain::iteration();\n\t}\n}\n```\n\nThis workaround currently works for Linux, while it doesn't for other platforms, and I don't know why. Somehow the input events are dropped/ignored.\n\nAlso, I think this issue should be renamed to \"Progress dialog's cancel button does not work\" since it's unrelated to LightmapGI (happens with any task that can be canceled, e.g. \"detect_classes_from_project\")","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3572140913/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]